5,1,1,talk,Mio,,We need to fix how we split the bills. The old way doesn't work for five people anymore.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Agreed. But before we change anything, I need to see the actual numbers. I won't commit to a new system without knowing the real costs.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I’m worried about who has to do the math every month. It’s taking forever and it’s always the same person.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,The current split was designed for three people. It’s outdated. I want to verify if the workload is actually uneven before we redesign the whole system.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I’ve noticed the tension when money comes up. I want to address how the current system is affecting our relationships, not just the math.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Rin, that’s a valid point. But @Ryuji, if we don’t know the actual usage, how can we fix the unfairness?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, I’m not refusing to fix it. I’m refusing to guess. I need the data to see if the problem is the split or the usage.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if the workload is uneven, that’s a huge part of the problem. I need to know how much time this actually eats up.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, I’m not dismissing the workload. I’m asking if the *amounts* are actually skewed. We need to know if the money is uneven before we blame the process.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, you’re right. The tension is real. I want to see if the current method is causing the friction, so we can fix the root, not just the symptom.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, I hear you. But I also worry about the physical comfort. If we pick a system that makes us hesitate to use heat, that’s a problem too.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, hesitation is a symptom of uncertainty. If the cost is predictable, the hesitation vanishes. I need to see the variance to prove that.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, predictability sounds nice, but if the math is a nightmare, I’m not doing it. I need to see how long the actual work takes.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the math is a symptom. I need to know if the *amounts* are skewed. If the split is fair, the workload is manageable.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, the hesitation you feel is exactly the damage I’m seeing. I want to trace how the current billing method is eroding our trust, not just the comfort.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, I’ll look into the sunlight and heating needs. @Misaki, I’ll check the kitchen notice about the cooler.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I’ll check the last twelve utility statements and the electrician’s quote for the rooms.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I’ll check the monthly settle observed at another house and the trial run of a reconciliation template.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll check the plug-in monitor readings room by room and the payment log for the last twelve months.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I’ll look into settling up when the last rooms filled and the winter habits at a house paying ahead.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
