36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"- **Ryuji**: The variance is brutal. February hit 29,400 yen, August was 9,100. No two months are close.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"- **Shunichi**: The payment log confirms the friction. Three months were settled late, always after someone questioned the amount.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: At the house paying ahead, the hall heater just stayed on all January. Nobody hesitated to use it.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,- **Mio**: The cooler notice stayed up all summer. People sweated rather than argue over the bill. That’s the hesitation I feel.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"- **Ryuji**: @Mio, that confirms the behavioral cost. But the electrician’s quote is 34,000 yen per room. That’s a massive upfront hit for five of us.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
